  "scope": "v316 adds only five visible production-reason leaf nodes, one read-only refresh assignment and scoped CSS. Exact eight-part inverse retains frozen v315. Current DOM adapters exclude only these five validated nodes, preserving all prior fields and repair repeat behavior; independent physical-removal and malformed-node boundaries cover all four comparators. v315 changes presentation only; exact expected-side render adaptation retains complete candidate paint, event, world, input and storage evidence. v314 suppresses only non-IME repeated Enter default activation on attack/build buttons. No new DOM projection. A strictly hash-locked current-only repair-suite case follows the intended attack Enter repeat contract while retaining full world/input/DOM/storage parity against equivalent intended activations; exact historical v272 still executes the original case. v313 adds a stable refinery-nearest-miner selection button, shared count/cohort logic, and exact new button subtree projection. Existing gameplay commands and economic rules remain unchanged. v312 suppresses repeated Escape keydown in the existing global repeat guard only; first Escape, other keys, native focused controls and gameplay rules remain unchanged. No new DOM projection. v311 adds low-contrast ground remnants only for depleted ore. Positive ore commands and all world rules remain unchanged; explicit ground-paint expected-side compatibility preserves prior assertions. No new DOM projection. v310 adds five building identification thumbnails at common scale, with decorative markup and read-only existing-toggle sync. Existing vehicle gallery and battlefield draw functions unchanged. Exact buildingReferenceGallery subtree is the sole new DOM projection. v309 adds a static five-vehicle recognition gallery to the existing folded reference. Exact captured original/preview SVG art, scoped CSS and read-only mode synchronization; exact uniquely attached vehicleReferenceGallery subtree is the sole new DOM